The easiest method is to temporarily use the Render external database URL locally:
cd C:\PROJECTS\EmailScheduler\backend
Temporarily place this in backend/.env:
DATABASE_URL=YOUR_RENDER_POSTGRES_EXTERNAL_URL
REDIS_URL=YOUR_RENDER_REDIS_EXTERNAL_URL
Then run:
npm install
npx prisma generate
npx prisma migrate deploy
npm run seed
This creates the Ethereal sender rows in the production database.

